ationand make the Source block\\n      // smarter about understanding when its args change.\\n      //\\n      // See https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/22807\",\n            \"end_line\": 68,\n            \"path\": \"code/addons/docs/src/blocks/blocks/SourceContainer.tsx\",\n            \"score\": 70,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-021704ab8188\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"process-step\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-8933b0cb2cce\",\n            \"start_line\": 45,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-71ed5fa1a258\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"handleAddValueAdd({ key, newValue }: any) {\\n    const { data, keyPath = [], nextDeep: deep } = this.state;\\n    const { beforeAddAction, logger } = this.props;\\n\\n    (beforeAddAction || Promise.resolve.bind(Promise))(key, keyPath, deep, newValue)\\n      .then(() => {\\n        // Update data\\n        data[key] = newValue;\\n        this.setState({\\n          data,\\n        });\\n        // Cancel add to close\\n        this.handleAddValueCancel();\\n        // Spread new update\\n        const { onUpdate, onDeltaUpdate } = this.props;\\n        onUpdate(keyPath[keyPath.length - 1], data);\\n        // Spread delta update\\n        onDeltaUpdate({\\n          type: deltaTypes.ADD_DELTA_TYPE,\\n          keyPath,\\n          deep,\\n          key,\\n          newValue,\\n        });\",\n            \"end_line\": 1096,\n            \"path\": \"code/addons/docs/src/blocks/controls/react-editable-json-tree/JsonNodes.tsx\",\n            \"score\": 70,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-29df99ba1d10\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"process-step\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-5512d4e0d7de\",\n            \"start_line\": 1073,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-76f1f454d43d\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"export function argsHash(args: Args): ArgsHash {\\n  return stringify(args, { maxDepth: 50 });\\n}\",\n            \"end_line\": 13,\n            \"path\": \"code/addons/docs/src/blocks/blocks/SourceContainer.tsx\",\n            \"score\": 69,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-a3c7f53135ae\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"process-step\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-8933b0cb2cce\",\n            \"start_line\": 11,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-7529d955d952\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"handleAddValueCancel() {\\n    this.setState({\\n      addFormVisible: false,\\n    });\\n  }\",\n            \"end_line\": 288,\n            \"path\": \"code/addons/docs/src/blocks/controls/react-editable-json-tree/JsonNodes.tsx\",\n            \"score\": 69,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-70201d4cea89\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"process-step\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-5512d4e0d7de\",\n            \"start_line\": 284,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-db52a1022da0\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"handleAddValueCancel() {\\n    this.setState({\\n      addFormVisible: false,\\n    });\\n  }\",\n            \"end_line\": 1071,\n            \"path\": \"code/addons/docs/src/blocks/controls/react-editable-json-tree/JsonNodes.tsx\",\n            \"score\": 68,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-1719d2eb1fb2\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"process-step\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-5512d4e0d7de\",\n            \"start_line\": 1067,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-de62181b4401\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"---\\ntitle: Addon migration guide for Storybook 10.0\\nsidebar:\\n  order: 9\\n  title: Migrate addons to 10.0\\n---\\n\\nWe sincerely appreciate the dedication and effort addon creators put into keeping the Storybook ecosystem vibrant and up-to-date. As Storybook evolves to version 10.0, bringing new features and improvements, this guide is here to assist you in migrating your addons from 9.x to 10.0. If you need to migrate your addon from an earlier version of Storybook, please first refer to the [Addon migration guide for Storybook 9.0](../../../release-9-1/docs/addons/addon-migration-guide.mdx).\\n\\n<Callout variant=\\\"info\\\">\\n  We also have a general [Storybook migration guide](../releases/migration-guide.mdx) that covers updates to your Storybook instance rather than your addon code.\\n</Callout>\\n\\n## Dependency updates\\n\\nYou will need to update your Storybook dependencies. Peer dependencies must point to `^10.0.0` to ensure broad compatibility for your end users. Development dependencies can be set to `^10.0.0`, or to `next` if you want to try the latest prerelease all year round.\\n\\n```jsonc title=\\\"package.json\\\"\\n{\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@storybook/addon-docs\\\": \\\"next\\\",\\n    \\\"@storybook/react-vite\\\": \\\"next\\\",\\n    \\\"storybook\\\": \\\"next\\\"\\n  },\",\n            \"end_line\": 24,\n            \"path\": \"docs/addons/addon-migration-guide.mdx\",\n            \"score\": 40,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-faf16c5d300d\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"file-preview\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-ac0bb0214913\",\n            \"start_line\": 1,\n            \"symbol_ids\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"---\\ntitle: 'ESLint plugin'\\nhideRendererSelector: true\\nsidebar:\\n  order: 5\\n  title: ESLint plugin\\n---\\n\\nStorybook provides a dedicated [ESLint plugin](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/tree/next/code/lib/eslint-plugin) to help you write stories and components aligned with the latest Storybook and frontend development best practices.\\n\\n## Installation\\n\\nYou'll first need to install [ESLint](https://eslint.org/):\\n\\n<CodeSnippets path=\\\"eslint-install.md\\\" />\\n\\nNext, install `eslint-plugin-storybook`:\\n\\n<CodeSnippets path=\\\"eslint-plugin-storybook-install.md\\\" />\\n\\nThen add `plugin:storybook/recommended` to the extends section of your `.eslintrc` configuration file. Note that we can omit the `eslint-plugin-` prefix:\\n\\n```js title=\\\".eslintrc\\\"\\n{\",\n            \"end_line\": 24,\n            \"path\": \"docs/configure/integration/eslint-plugin.mdx\",\n            \"score\": 40,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-02da54df4f01\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"file-preview\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-eb4e26337f84\",\n            \"start_line\": 1,\n            \"symbol_ids\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"module.exports = {\\n  coreFrameworks: ['react', 'vue', 'angular', 'web-components'],\\n  communityFrameworks: ['ember', 'html', 'svelte', 'preact', 'qwik', 'solid'],\\n  featureGroups: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'Essentials',\\n      features: [\\n        {\\n          name: 'Actions',\\n          unsupported: [],\\n          path: 'essentials/actions',\\n        },\\n        {\\n          name: 'Backgrounds',\\n          unsupported: [],\\n          path: 'essentials/backgrounds',\\n        },\\n        {\\n          name: 'Docs',\\n          unsupported: [],\\n          path: 'writing-docs',\\n        },\\n        {\\n          name: 'Viewport',\",\n            \"end_line\": 24,\n            \"path\": \"docs/frameworks.js\",\n            \"score\": 40,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-66729799b62e\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"file-preview\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-78f03ac88796\",\n            \"start_line\": 1,\n            \"symbol_ids\": []\n          }\n        ],\n        \"title\": \"docs 研究包\",\n        \"type_surfaces\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"child_page_rollup\": [\n          {\n            \"child_digest\": [\n              \"主题摘要：该专题聚焦命令入口、参数解析和执行主链。；关联模块：core；关联模块：cli-sb；关联模块：cli-storybook；关联模块：create-storybook\"\n            ],\n            \"diagram_rollup\"